@startuml offering-fulfillment-boundary
title Offering / Fulfillment Process Boundary ; per ADR-ES-021 section 9

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Fulfillment Process" as FP
class "Offering" as O

FP --> O : fulfills
O --> FP : fulfilled-through
O -[dotted]- FP : is NOT
FP -[dotted]- O : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-021 section 9:
  Offering fulfilled-through Fulfillment Process. The Fulfillment
  Process is what fulfills the Offering, but an Offering is NOT
  a Fulfillment Process.
end note

@enduml
